<p>Surround yourself with Pure Aether, increasing all your arcane damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2.5%, 5.0%, 6.9%, 8.6%, 10%</acronym> and ignoring <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 29%, 37%, 42%, 46%</acronym> arcane resistance of your targets.</p><p>At level 5 casting Aether Avatar removes up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> magical or physical detrimental effects.</p>